aj Chordia, 6KIOM stands for “6000 Miles to Isle of Man” – a symbolic journey representing every rider's pursuit of excellence, freedom, and purpose. Not on a flight, but on two wheels. Through real experiences, skill-building, and the unbreakable bond of community.","mobile_description_color":"#1b1b1b","mobile_description_font_size":16,"show_center_image":true,"center_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/92.png","center_image_alt":"Journey center image","center_image_width":390,"center_image_height":390,"center_image_mobile_width":110,"center_image_mobile_height":110,"show_journey_1":true,"journey_1_heading":"Today","journey_1_color":"#68953f","journey_1_font_size":32,"journey_1_content":"Under the leadership of Sambhav Nahar, 6KIOM has become much more than a gear store. We’re a movement.","journey_1_content_color":"#1b1b1b","journey_1_content_font_size":16,"journey_1_align_right":false,"show_journey_2":true,"journey_2_heading":"2017","journey_2_color":"#1b1b1b","journey_2_font_size":32,"journey_2_content":"We launched our 10,000 sq. ft. experience centre – the largest of its kind in the heart of Bengaluru – a haven for riders, dreamers, and adventurers.","journey_2_content_color":"#1b1b1b","journey_2_content_font_size":16,"journey_2_align_right":true,"show_journey_3":true,"journey_3_heading":"2015","journey_3_color":"#1b1b1b","journey_3_font_size":32,"journey_3_content":"A humble 20x30 ft. store, quickly evolved into something much bigger.","journey_3_content_color":"#1b1b1b","journey_3_content_font_size":16,"journey_3_align_right":true}},"176474586239f646b4":{"type":"_blocks","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"custom_our_journey_mobile_Mcm3EN":{"type":"custom-our-journey-mobile","name":"Our Journey Mobile","settings":{"bg_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_48478.png","heading":"<p>OUR <em>JOURNEY<\/em><\/p>","heading_font_size":28,"heading_color":"#1b1b1b","heading_highlight_color":"#68953f","main_description":"At 6KIOM, we believe motorcycling isn't just a passion – it's a way of life. Born from the vision of Pushp Raj Chordia, 6KIOM stands for “6000 Miles to Isle of Man” – a symbolic journey representing every rider's pursuit of excellence, freedom, and purpose. Not on a flight, but on two wheels. Through real experiences, skill-building, and the unbreakable bond of community.","description_font_size":16,"description_color":"#1b1b1b","center_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/92.png","center_image_width":110,"center_image_height":110,"center_image_top":12,"center_image_left":-24,"timeline1_top":0,"timeline1_alignment":"right","timeline1_year":"2015","timeline1_year_size":20,"timeline1_year_color":"#1b1b1b","timeline1_desc":"A humble 20x30 ft. store, quickly evolved into something much bigger.","timeline1_desc_size":14,"timeline1_desc_color":"#1b1b1b","timeline2_top":22,"timeline2_alignment":"left","timeline2_year":"2017","timeline2_year_size":20,"timeline2_year_color":"#1b1b1b","timeline2_desc":"We launched our 10,000 sq. ft. experience centre – the largest of its kind in the heart of Bengaluru – a haven for riders, dreamers, and adventurers.","timeline2_desc_size":14,"timeline2_desc_color":"#1b1b1b","timeline3_top":83,"timeline3_alignment":"right","timeline3_year":"Today","timeline3_year_size":20,"timeline3_year_color":"#68953f","timeline3_desc":"Under the leadership of Sambhav Nahar, 6KIOM is more than a gear store. **We're a movement.**","timeline3_desc_size":14,"timeline3_desc_color":"#1b1b1b"}},"custom_journey_bottom_D9RKr3":{"type":"custom-journey-bottom","disabled":true,"name":"Journey Bottom","settings":{"left_heading":"<p>WHAT <strong>DRIVES US<\/strong><\/p>","left_heading_size":48,"left_heading_color":"#ffffff","left_highlight_color":"#fdd500","left_description":"<p>We're powered by the 6 pillars of 6KIOM, forged over years of on-ground experience and industry insight. These guide everything we do – from selecting the world's best riding gear to crafting unforgettable rider experiences.<\/p>","left_desc_size":18,"left_desc_color":"#ffffff","left_bg_color":"#68953f","right_heading":"<p>OUR <strong>VISION<\/strong><\/p>","right_heading_size":48,"right_heading_color":"#1b1b1b","right_highlight_color":"#68953f","right_description":"<p>We're on a mission to take Indian motorcycling to global levels, building a community that's well-equipped, well-informed, and well-connected. From educating and training riders, to working with clubs and organizing rides, we aim to structure and uplift the motorcycling ecosystem in India using international best practices.<\/p>","right_desc_size":18,"right_desc_color":"#000000","right_bg_color":"#ffffff"}},"custom_tracking_ikVd76":{"type":"custom-tracking","name":"Track Order","settings":{}},"custom_collection_slideshow_xLbNiW":{"type":"custom-collection-slideshow","blocks":{"collection_tab_YUDmPn":{"type":"collection_tab","settings":{"collection":"bookmarks","collection_main_img":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_141.png","collection_image_alt":"","custom_tab_title":"","enable_wishlist":true,"badge_text":"bestseller"}},"collection_tab_d8rtiz":{"type":"collection_tab","settings":{"collection":"bookmarks","collection_main_img":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Kai_and_Paedyn.jpg","collection_image_alt":"","custom_tab_title":"","enable_wishlist":true,"badge_text":""}},"collection_tab_J4WAyk":{"type":"collection_tab","settings":{"collection":"powerlss","collection_main_img":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/bf1cd081-0012-4f2f-be7c-4685eac96176.jpg","collection_image_alt":"","custom_tab_title":"","enable_wishlist":false,"badge_text":"Bestseller"}}},"block_order":["collection_tab_YUDmPn","collection_tab_d8rtiz","collection_tab_J4WAyk"],"disabled":true,"name":"Collection Slideshow","settings":{"right_panel_bg":"#f9e782","main_heading":"Jewels Made For The Way You Shine","main_heading_color":"#000000","main_heading_size":28,"desc":"Turn every evening into an occasion with jewellery that speaks the language of allure. Designed for red lips, stiletto heels, and dresses that command attention, this collection is all about confidence and charm. Each piece in sterling silver adds just the right touch of shine — never overpowering, always unforgettable.","desc_color":"#000000","desc_size":14,"wishlist_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector.svg","cart_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_1076_1.svg","arrow_prev_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/L.svg","arrow_next_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/R.svg"}},"custom_spotlight_banner_GihWrd":{"type":"custom-spotlight-banner","disabled":true,"name":"Spotlight Banner","settings":{"bg_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_48235_1.png","banner_bg":"#fefc99","banner_logo":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Group_1.png","banner_text":"GET 20% OFF TILL 23 OCT!","banner_font_size":18,"banner_font_color":"#000000","main_text":"MADE FOR THE SPOLIGHT","main_text_font_size":40,"main_text_font_color":"#ffffff"}},"custom_biker_pilgrimage_ccBtdK":{"type":"custom-biker-pilgrimage","name":"Biker Pilgrimage","settings":{"bg_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_48477_9.png","bg_image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_48477_10.png","title_text":"The bikers' pilgrimage","title_font_size":24,"title_color":"#1b1b1b","para1_text":"There's nothing on earth quite like the Isle of Man TT race. No other motorcycle race throws as many challenges as this course does: bends, bumps, jumps, stone walls, manhole covers, and telegraph poles—you name them all. The race has been a regular fixture since 1907, but in that time the circuit has changed remarkably little.","para2_text":"A combination of precision driving, quick reflexes, and sheer bravery is mandatory to even finish respectably. And to win is to turn immortal. So it's not for nothing that the Isle of Man TT race is on the bucket list of every biker worth his salt.","para3_text":"Once a year, motorcycle enthusiasts from around the globe flock to the Isle of Man—the racing mecca—for the oldest race in motorcycle history. Bikers from all over the world with great conviction and that modicum of madness, converge here to win at the races, defying history and death. This glorious race sees high-octane engine-sized adrenaline junkies zoom, curve and dip through a 37.5 mile long loop at a frightening 130 mph average speed, competing for top rank, risking life and limb in the process.","para_font_size":18,"para_color":"#1b1b1b"}},"custom_stacked_cards_hiF8Kx":{"type":"custom-stacked-cards","blocks":{"card_6ihkLn":{"type":"card","settings":{"reverse_layout":false,"card_color":"#262626","card_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Group_3.png","card_title":"Join the Clan","card_title_size":26,"card_title_color":"#ffffff","card_desc":"6KIOM is a real cool crazy meeting place for like-minded bikers. Get to attend weekly\/monthly biking events to get the best out of your biking lifestyle. Be a part of some of the most happening biking activities all year round. Gear up and step into the biker’s version of paradise! It’s your complete pit stop for all things biking! Come discover what’s in store for you and pick up your membership today.","card_desc_size":18,"card_desc_color":"#ffffff","card_clip_path":"polygon(100% 50%, 87.22% 100%, 7.5% 100%, 0% 50%, 7.5% 0%, 100% 0%)","card_clip_path_mobile":"polygon(100% 79.66%, 90.11% 100%, 0% 100%, 0% 20.34%, 9.89% 0%, 100% 0%)"}},"card_XXJEty":{"type":"card","settings":{"reverse_layout":true,"card_color":"#4b4b4b","card_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Group_4.png","card_title":"Thrill 'n' Chill","card_title_size":24,"card_title_color":"#ffffff","card_desc":"Live every race watching motorsports screenings in an ambience charged with bonhomie. Unwind with live MotoGPs & WSB screenings. Step up life’s tempo with live gigs, events & launches. Unwind here with live music & jamming sessions. It’ll be the kind of entertainment that appeals to you. Meet fellow bikers, experts & manufacturers to know the latest in the world of biking. It’s the nuggets you pick up that will make every visit worth it.","card_desc_size":18,"card_desc_color":"#ffffff","card_clip_path":"polygon(100% 50%, 92.52% 100%, 13.47% 100%, 0% 50%, 7.5% 0%, 92.5% 0%)","card_clip_path_mobile":"polygon(100% 20.34%, 100% 100%, 9.89% 100%, 0% 79.66%, 0% 0%, 90.11% 0%)"}},"card_qDFrME":{"type":"card","settings":{"reverse_layout":false,"card_color":"#262626","card_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_1.png","card_title":"Nuts and Bolts","card_title_size":24,"card_title_color":"#ffffff","card_desc":"They say, get to know her before you ride her! Get the best bike care and repair tips from professionals along with DIY sessions. That’s the real deal about being an out-and-out biker. So learn to get your hands dirty. You never know when it’ll pay off.","card_desc_size":18,"card_desc_color":"#ffffff","card_clip_path":"polygon(100% 50%, 87.22% 100%, 7.5% 100%, 0% 50%, 7.5% 0%, 100% 0%)","card_clip_path_mobile":"polygon(0% 8%, 100% 8%, 100% 92%, 0% 92%)"}},"card_rkKLyD":{"type":"card","settings":{"reverse_layout":true,"card_color":"#4b4b4b","card_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Group_8.png","card_title":"Card Title","card_title_size":22,"card_title_color":"#ffffff","card_desc":"Card description here.","card_desc_size":15,"card_desc_color":"#cccccc","card_clip_path":"polygon(48px 0%, calc(100% - 48px) 0%, 100% 50%, calc(100% - 48px) 100%, 48px 100%, 0% 50%)","card_clip_path_mobile":"pol